vt100 0.16.2
------------

This repository includes a locally modified copy of the vt100 crate in
vendor/vt100, based on the published vt100 0.16.2 release.

Upstream project: https://github.com/doy/vt100-rust
Published crate: https://crates.io/crates/vt100/0.16.2
Copyright (c) 2016 Jesse Luehrs
License: MIT

The upstream copyright notice and full MIT license text are preserved in
vendor/vt100/LICENSE. The project's root LICENSE does not replace third-party
copyright notices or license terms.

Local modifications:

- Add Screen::set_scrollback_len and the corresponding grid operation to adjust
  retained normal-screen scrollback without rebuilding the terminal parser.
- Remove excess oldest rows, clamp the scrollback view offset, and shrink the
  scrollback queue when its capacity is reduced.
- Preserve terminal screens, cursor state, modes, and incomplete escape/UTF-8
  parsing state. The alternate screen retains its upstream zero-scrollback
  behavior.
- Retain runtime dependencies in the local Cargo manifest; omit upstream
  development dependencies and unpublished test fixtures.

